Configuration  of  PHYs is necessary.  See The device driver pro‐
vides support for RDC R6040 Fast  Ethernet  controller  which  is
commonly found on Vortex86 System On a Chip (SoC).  The RDC R6040
has integrated 10/100 PHY for 10/100Mbps support in full or half‐
duplex.   The controller supports interrupt moderation mechanism,
a 64‐bit multicast hash filter, VLAN  over‐size  frame  and  four
station  addresses.   The  device  driver  uses three station ad‐
dresses out of four as perfect multicast filter.   The  following
variables are available Maximum number of packets to fire RX com‐
pletion  interrupt.   The  accepted range is 0 (disable interrupt
moderation) to 15, the default is 0.  Maximum number  of  packets
to  fire  TX completion interrupt.  The accepted range is 0 (dis‐
able interrupt moderation) to 15, the default is 0.   The  driver
